{"kind":"html","caption":"用哑结点统一处理删除头结点的情况，让快指针先走 n 步，再让快慢指针同步前进。快指针到达链表末尾时，慢指针恰好停在待删除结点的前一个位置，修改一次 next 即可完成删除。示例中 n = 2，最终跳过结点 4，得到 [1,2,3,5]。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>删除链表的倒数第 N 个结点</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.status{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.45}\n.step{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.chain-wrap{overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 0}\n.chain{display:flex;align-items:stretch;min-width:320px;gap:2px}\n.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;text-align:center;flex:0 0 38px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,opacity .35s}\n.node .value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2}\n.node .name{font-size:10px;color:#3794ff;margin-top:2px}\n.node .pointers{min-height:14px;margin-top:2px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:2px}\n.badge{padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:#3c3c3c;font-size:10px}\n.arrow{flex:0 0 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.node.active .value{color:#fff}\n.node.target{background:#4a2f2f;border-color:#f48771}\n.node.removed{opacity:.28;border-style:dashed}\n.arrow.cut{color:#f48771;text-decoration:line-through}\n.arrow.jump{color:#3794ff;font-weight:bold}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border-radius:2px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.blue{background:#0e639c;border:1px solid #3794ff}\n.red{background:#4a2f2f;border:1px solid #f48771}\n.explain{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.card{padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border-radius:4px;line-height:1.4;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}\n.card strong{display:block;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:2px}\ncode{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress>div{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>快慢指针删倒数第 n 个</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\"><code>[1,2,3,4,5]</code>，<code>n=2</code>，自动循环</p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"chain-wrap\"><div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot blue\"></i>指针</span><span><i class=\"dot red\"></i>待删</span><span><code>dummy</code> 统一头删</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"explain\">\n<div class=\"card\"><strong>1. 建立间隔</strong>fast 先走 n 步。</div>\n<div class=\"card\"><strong>2. 同步移动</strong>至 fast.next 为空。</div>\n<div class=\"card\"><strong>3. 跳过目标</strong>slow.next = slow.next.next</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const values = ['dummy', '1', '2', '3', '4', '5'];\n  const steps = [\n    { text: '加入哑结点，fast 与 slow 都从 dummy 出发。', fast: 0, slow: 0 },\n    { text: 'fast 先走第 1 步，到达结点 1。', fast: 1, slow: 0 },\n    { text: 'fast 先走第 2 步，到达结点 2；间隔 n = 2 已建立。', fast: 2, slow: 0 },\n    { text: '两指针同步前进：slow 到 1，fast 到 3。', fast: 3, slow: 1 },\n    { text: '继续同步前进：slow 到 2，fast 到 4。', fast: 4, slow: 2 },\n    { text: '继续同步前进：fast 到尾结点 5，slow 到结点 3。', fast: 5, slow: 3 },\n    { text: 'fast.next 为空，slow.next（结点 4）就是倒数第 2 个结点。', fast: 5, slow: 3, target: 4 },\n    { text: '让结点 3 直接指向结点 5，跳过结点 4。结果为 [1,2,3,5]。', fast: 5, slow: 3, target: 4, removed: true }\n  ];\n  const chain = document.getElementById('chain');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n\n  function render(stepIndex) {\n    const s = steps[stepIndex];\n    chain.innerHTML = '';\n    values.forEach(function (value, i) {\n      const node = document.createElement('div');\n      node.className = 'node';\n      if (i === s.fast || i === s.slow) node.classList.add('active');\n      if (i === s.target) node.classList.add('target');\n      if (s.removed && i === 4) node.classList.add('removed');\n\n      const pointerNames = [];\n      if (i === s.fast) pointerNames.push('<span class=\"badge\">fast</span>');\n      if (i === s.slow) pointerNames.push('<span class=\"badge\">slow</span>');\n      node.innerHTML = '<div class=\"value\">' + (i === 0 ? 'D' : value) + '</div>' +\n        '<div class=\"name\">' + (i === 0 ? 'dummy' : value) + '</div>' +\n        '<div class=\"pointers\">' + pointerNames.join('') + '</div>';\n      chain.appendChild(node);\n\n      if (i < values.length - 1) {\n        const arrow = document.createElement('div');\n        arrow.className = 'arrow';\n        arrow.textContent = '→';\n        if (s.removed && i === 3) {\n          arrow.classList.add('jump');\n          arrow.textContent = '↠';\n        }\n        if (s.removed && i === 4) arrow.classList.add('cut');\n        chain.appendChild(arrow);\n      }\n    });\n    status.innerHTML = '<span class=\"step\">步骤 ' + (stepIndex + 1) + ' / ' + steps.length + '</span><br>' + s.text;\n    progress.style.width = ((stepIndex + 1) / steps.length * 100) + '%';\n  }\n\n  let current = 0;\n  render(current);\n  setInterval(function () {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(current);\n  }, 1900);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
